@startuml seq-checkAvailability
title checkAvailability - UC01 steps 1-2
actor Member as A
participant ":BookingController" as C
participant ":Workspace" as W
participant "r : Resource" as R

A -> C : checkAvailability(resourceIds, date, startTime, endTime)

loop for each resourceId
  C -> W : findResource(resourceId)
  W --> C : r
  C -> R : isAvailable(date, startTime, endTime)
  R --> C : true/false
  C -> R : getFaults()
  R --> C : faults
end

note right of R : whether a resource with a fault can be booked is open (CQ06)

C --> A : availability and any faults
@enduml
